OL,5,G1930 Tom Kerridge Cooks Italy
OL,6,     FTom explores Italy's mountains,
OL,7,     Funcovering the culinary secrets of
OL,8,     Fchestnuts and pasta. In
OL,9,     FEmilia-Romagna's Apennines, he
OL,10,     Fjoins producer Adrian for the
OL,11,     Fchestnut harvest, then prepares
OL,12,     Fpork loin with chestnuts and wild
OL,13,     Fmushrooms. Later, amid the
OL,14,     Fspectacular Dolomites, he
OL,15,     Fdiscovers how the fresh mountain
OL,16,     Fenvironment shapes the region's
OL,17,     Fdistinctive cuisine today
